The following parts of this project are a Kotlin port of that project's
implementation, and have been modified for the Android platform:

  app/src/main/java/com/leehe/vota/crypto/VivoProtocol.kt
      Kotlin port of the AES-128-CBC helpers, the protocol package
      builder/parser, and the URL-safe base64 helpers
      (upstream: aes_encrypt / aes_decrypt / build_protocol_package /
       extract_encrypted_body / base64_url_encode / base64_url_decode /
       encrypt_to_jvq / decrypt_response).
      Modified: reimplemented with javax.crypto in place of PyCryptodome;
      documentation rewritten; padding-tolerant base64 decoder added.

  app/src/main/java/com/leehe/vota/data/OtaRepository.kt
      Kotlin port of the request-parameter construction and the response
      parser (upstream: build_request_params / join_params /
       extract_json_str / normalize_json_url / parse_update_response).
      Modified: rewritten in Kotlin with an ordered map, unit-testable
      error reporting, and explicit verbose logging hooks.

  app/src/main/java/com/leehe/vota/net/OtaHttpClient.kt
      Kotlin port of the HTTP transport (upstream: SSLAdapter / http_post /
       send_encrypted_request).
      Modified: uses HttpURLConnection with a custom X509TrustManager
      instead of requests + urllib3, so that no third-party HTTP client is
      required; retry policy moved to the caller.

  tools/protocol_check.py
      Cross-check helper that imports the upstream implementation directly
      in order to verify that this port produces identical derived values.
      It is not part of the application and is not distributed in the APK.

